    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cradle of Nightmares: Flowers to You is an ATB turn-based game based on combat adventures made by RPGMaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as a high school student named Le Qing, as the world is being torn apart by a mysterious phenomenon from outside the world, the &quot;White Light&quot;, and you will start from the ordinary daily life and fall into the dark and gloomy &quot;Second World&quot;, where you will embark on a journey to find your best friends, fight against the madmen under the invasion of emptiness, and finally end the filthy fate of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Fall into darkness at the moment~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Soul-mimicking gameplay system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the &quot;flower basket&quot; as the node, the map exploration is carried out in a propulsive manner, as well as the appropriate shortcut and regional connectivity design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In battle, accumulate special skills with basic attack/defense/skills, and release strong attack skills to turn the tide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main and secondary hands cooperate with the strike, the attribute restraint of spells, the backstab system, etc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Thoughts converge into light~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Rich weapon skill design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A skill set with 2~5 skills as a weapon, rich loadout slots, off-hands, and spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Turn-based but unique battle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The enemy/player swing back and forth design reduces the unpredictability of the traditional turn-based system and strengthens the player's sense of grasp of the battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Ran, I am a round of the sun~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Quite a wealth of maps, enemies, and boss battles to meet players' expectations for map exploration and fighting against strong enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of plot and NPC side quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special NPC frenzy battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings, multi-week inherited gameplay, and difficulty increases in the process</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/857ff062de987af72eaab0054ad45ece.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/857ff062de987af72eaab0054ad45ece.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/857ff062de987af72eaab0054ad45ece.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/4f5911ae64da37fe4518bb6f5f0b2386.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/4f5911ae64da37fe4518bb6f5f0b2386.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/4f5911ae64da37fe4518bb6f5f0b2386.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cradle of Nightmares: Flowers to You is an ATB turn-based game based on combat adventures made by RPGMaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as a high school student named Le Qing, as the world is being torn apart by a mysterious phenomenon from outside the world, the &quot;White Light&quot;, and you will start from the ordinary daily life and fall into the dark and gloomy &quot;Second World&quot;, where you will embark on a journey to find your best friends, fight against the madmen under the invasion of emptiness, and finally end the filthy fate of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Fall into darkness at the moment~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Soul-mimicking gameplay system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the &quot;flower basket&quot; as the node, the map exploration is carried out in a propulsive manner, as well as the appropriate shortcut and regional connectivity design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In battle, accumulate special skills with basic attack/defense/skills, and release strong attack skills to turn the tide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main and secondary hands cooperate with the strike, the attribute restraint of spells, the backstab system, etc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/25c53a737ba8814082bb4042d9b095f7.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Thoughts converge into light~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Rich weapon skill design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A skill set with 2~5 skills as a weapon, rich loadout slots, off-hands, and spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Turn-based but unique battle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The enemy/player swing back and forth design reduces the unpredictability of the traditional turn-based system and strengthens the player's sense of grasp of the battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.poster.avif?t=1742539858\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.webm?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469850/extras/015f10e32c3709afa66194259dbbb011.mp4?t=1742539858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~Ran, I am a round of the sun~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Quite a wealth of maps, enemies, and boss battles to meet players' expectations for map exploration and fighting against strong enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of plot and NPC side quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special NPC frenzy battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings, multi-week inherited gameplay, and difficulty increases in the process</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i